change each  w_i  in proportion to  \Delta_i  and a small real-valued learning rate As of 2014, this simple BP method is still the central learning algorithm for FNNs and RNNs. Notably, most contest-winning NNs up to 2014 (Sec. 5.12, 5.14, 5.17, 5.19, 5.21, 5.22) did  not  augment supervised BP by some sort of  unsupervised  learning as discussed in Sec. 5.7, 5.10, 5.15.
